WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.184
Bird's stamps flew everywhere!

2
00:00:07.185 --> 00:00:14.564
Some landed in the branches.

3
00:00:14.565 --> 00:00:18.874
Some landed on the grass.

4
00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:24.949
One stamp landed somewhere else.

5
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:36.288
"I am so sorry, Bird!" said Kip.

6
00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:40.967
"It's okay," said Bird.

7
00:00:40.968 --> 00:00:43.510
"I can find the stamps."

8
00:00:43.511 --> 00:00:52.252
"No," said Kip. " We can find the

9
00:00:52.253 --> 00:00:58.012
stamps." The two friends looked for Bird's

10
00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:02.801
stamps. Bird looked

11
00:01:02.802 --> 00:01:14.267
high. And Kip looked

12
00:01:14.268 --> 00:01:18.609
low. Bird found some up in the branches.

13
00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:28.260
Kip found some down in the grass.

14
00:01:28.261 --> 00:01:33.363
Soon they had a bunch of stamps.

15
00:01:33.364 --> 00:01:40.892
They brought them back to Bird's nest.

16
00:01:40.893 --> 00:01:51.417
Bird put the stamps back in the box.

17
00:01:51.418 --> 00:02:05.756
Kip looked around one more time.

18
00:02:05.757 --> 00:02:14.329
"I don't see any more stamps," Kip said.

19
00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:20.379
"I think we found all of them."

20
00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:27.606
"No," said Bird. "One stamp is missing.

21
00:02:27.607 --> 00:02:35.186
And it's my favorite one—the bird stamp!"

